STRING 1615
{
Despite recent turmoil, the Capital City of Lordaeron enjoys a time of peace and prosperity. News of a mysterious plague spreading across the land has reached its citizens, but most dismiss it as rumor and hearsay. What the people do excitedly discuss is the imminent return of Prince Arthas, whose ship has been sighted off the northern coast after many weeks at sea.

Garek Bandarion, a lieutenant in the city guard, runs through his morning drills as he awaits the day’s orders from Captain Landen…

}

